# P108 on WSL GtkBackend: a held drag, then a throw, after the app's own FREE and BOUND; the steps of
# actions/win/P108-throw-gtk4.actions (its header gives the order and why HOLD comes first).
# Measured 2026-10-20 on p108-wslg-final-20261020-090456.png, client coordinates (origin left empty,
# the frame offset (38, 59) taken off): the card is 40x40 at x 20-60, y 100-140, centre (40, 120).
# Pass: HOLD releases at offset 20 with velocity 0 and no coast; THROW releases with the speed over
# the last 0.1 s of the points as received and coasts on the closed form.
# P108(WSL):先停住再拋擲，步驟同 Windows GTK 檔；卡片中心 (40, 120),client 座標。
